1
00:00:00,512 --> 00:00:02,802
- Individual relish packets? Onion rings?
- Yes.

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:05,223
- Extra breading? What did they say?
- I asked. No.

3
00:00:05,392 --> 00:00:07,642
- Did you protest? Vociferously?
- Yes. No.

4
00:00:07,811 --> 00:00:09,891
(Sheldon:)Well, then, what took you so long?

5
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:13,353
(Leonard:)Just eat.

6
00:00:13,692 --> 00:00:17,322
- Hey, guys. What'd I miss, what'd I miss?
- Giselle's hanging by a thread.

7
00:00:17,487 --> 00:00:19,567
(Penny:)Oh, good, I hate her.

8
00:00:19,906 --> 00:00:22,826
(Howard:)Then you're not invited to our wedding.

9
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,910
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

10
00:00:25,078 --> 00:00:26,458
(Sheldon:)Oh, do we have to suffer...

11
00:00:26,621 --> 00:00:29,621
(Sheldon:)...through this transparently manipulative,
pseudo-reality again?

12
00:00:29,791 --> 00:00:31,001
ALL:
Yes.

13
00:00:31,293 --> 00:00:33,213
(Sheldon:)You and I have a standing TV schedule...

14
00:00:33,378 --> 00:00:35,718
(Sheldon:)...the result of extensive debate
and compromise.

15
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,880
(Sheldon:)Any alterations
except for breaking news...

16
00:00:38,049 --> 00:00:41,469
(Sheldon:)...have to be pre-approved
at the weekly roommate meeting.

17
00:00:42,053 --> 00:00:43,093
(Leonard:)Put it on the agenda.

18
00:00:43,263 --> 00:00:44,893
(Sheldon:)You have to make a motion.

19
00:00:45,056 --> 00:00:47,686
(Leonard:)I'll make a motion
but you're not gonna like it.

20
00:00:49,728 --> 00:00:52,268
(Sheldon:)Fine. Mock parliamentary procedure.

21
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:53,769
(Sheldon:)At least put it on mute.

22
00:00:54,983 --> 00:00:57,023
(Penny:)Oh, Giselle's not getting kicked off.

23
00:00:57,193 --> 00:00:58,573
It's totally gonna be Summer.

24
00:00:58,737 --> 00:01:01,027
[SQUEALS]

